            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0818" n="690" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg690"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/259: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-12T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 12,
                                1928—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>95. Foreign Minister states that the Government of Argentina is doing nothing at
                    the present time in the way of mediation and has no objection to any action
                    which the Conference may take.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi> for <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
